# Runtime configuration
#
# The official site uses the single primary Supabase project configured in
# src/supabase.ts with a browser-safe publishable key.
# Do not add a separate preview/test database.
# Never put service_role or any secret key in frontend code or this file.
#
# If the approved primary connection is rotated, update src/supabase.ts
# through a reviewed code change and rerun TypeScript and production build.
